<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>For Akanksha ❤️</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffc0cb, #ffdde1);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ff4d6d;
            font-size: 3em;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            line-height: 1.7em;
        }
        .heart {
            font-size: 4em;
            color: red;
            animation: beat 1s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes beat {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
        .button {
            background: #ff4d6d;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background: #e63950;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="heart">❤️</div>
        <h1>Dear Akanksha</h1>

        <p>
            I’m really sorry for everything that hurt you.<br>
            I never want to be the reason behind your tears.<br><br>

            You mean so much to me, more than I can ever explain in words.
            My heart feels complete only with you.  
        </p>

        <h2 style="color:#ff4d6d;">I love you so much, Akanksha ❤️</h2>

        <p>
            I want to make things right…  
            I want to make you smile…  
            I want to hold your hand and never let go.  
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="#">Always Yours</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
